      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors In deciding whether to tender your Medtronic Ordinary Shares, you should carefully consider in their entirety the matters described in \u201cRisk Factors,\u201d those described in \u201cRisk Factors\u201d in the Medtronic Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended April 24, 2026, incorporated by reference herein, as well as other information included in this prospectus and the other documents incorporated by reference herein. Regulatory Approval Certain acquisitions of MiniMed Common Stock under the Exchange Offer may require a premerger notification filing under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act. If you decide to participate in the Exchange Offer and acquire enough shares of MiniMed Common Stock to exceed the $133.9 million threshold stated in the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act and associated regulations, and if no exemption under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act or associated regulations applies, Medtronic",
